  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solid Waste Management Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(1) Increase the quality, availability and financial sustainability of solid-waste services in participating areas; (2) Increase administrative and technical capacity for solid waste management at the local and Entity level; (3) Improve the cost recovery mechanism of the sector to encourage private sector involvement; and (4) Correct environmental problems and reduce health hazards caused by inadequate waste collection and disposal systems.</narrative>
  </description>
